<title>UK: BP cuts Rotterdam refinery runs due to poor margin.</title>
<headline>BP cuts Rotterdam refinery runs due to poor margin.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Petroleum cut refinery runs at its Rotterdam refinery by 40 percent from midnight on Wednesday due to poor margins, traders said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Traders familiar with refinery operations said BP had cut runs by the equivalent of 10 percent for the month of May, which translated into a 40 percent cut for the balance of May.</p>
</text>
